    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18202" root="زنبر" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْبَرِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Large,</i> or <i>bulky;</i> applied to a ship:
(K:) you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفِينَةٌ زَنْبَرِيَّةٌ</span> <i>a large,</i> or <i>bulky,
ship:</i> (TA:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْبَرِيَّةٌ</span> signifies <i>a sort of large,</i>
or <i>bulky, ship.</i> (S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زبر</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Heavy;</i>
applied to a man. (K.)

